The programs of conformance/ported/ whose names begin with koka_, effekt_, swift_
and hylo_ translate into Stilt test programs of the projects below. The first
comment of each names the file it translates, and says where Stilt's meaning or
output differs from the original's, whose expectations the test otherwise keeps.
Each is distributed under the license of the project it comes from, whose notice
follows.

